# Rule: The technology choices for this repo

## Goal

To guide the AI assistant with technology it uses to solve the task at hand.

## Technologies

We use the following technologies in this repo:

- React
- NextJS @ 15
- Tailwindcss @ 4
- Markdown

## Ongoing

Other useful technologies will be added to this list as we feel they add value, please feel free to suggest new options that may solve the task at hand in a more simple, cleaner way.